IT'S OKAY, NIK.
YOU CAN LET IT OUT.

448
00:17:55,379 --> 00:17:56,647
IT'S OKAY.

449
00:17:56,647 --> 00:17:58,282
YOU'RE A FINALIST.

450
00:17:58,282 --> 00:17:59,383
CONGRATULATIONS.

451
00:17:59,383 --> 00:18:01,418
THANK YOU SO MUCH,
ALL OF YOU.

452
00:18:01,418 --> 00:18:03,754
THANK YOU.

453
00:18:03,754 --> 00:18:05,356
WILL BRE AND NICOLE
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

454
00:18:07,792 --> 00:18:09,760
I HAVE
ONE PHOTO IN MY HANDS,

455
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:12,797
AND I WILL ONLY CALL
ONE NAME.

456
00:18:12,797 --> 00:18:14,298
THE GIRL
THAT I DO NOT CALL

457
00:18:14,298 --> 00:18:15,966
MUST IMMEDIATELY GO
BACK TO YOUR HOTEL,

458
00:18:15,966 --> 00:18:19,236
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS,
AND GO HOME.

459
00:18:19,236 --> 00:18:21,438
YOU GUYS HAVE PERFORMED
IN THE PAST IN A COMMERCIAL,

460
00:18:21,438 --> 00:18:23,340
AND BOTH DID REALLY WELL,

461
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:26,844
BUT THE COVER GIRL COMMERCIAL,
YOU BOTH DIDN'T DELIVER.

462
00:18:26,844 --> 00:18:31,448
ONE GIRL HAS TAKEN
CONSISTENTLY BEAUTIFUL PICTURES.

463
00:18:31,448 --> 00:18:33,717
BUT THE OTHER GIRL
STARTED WEAKLY,

464
00:18:33,717 --> 00:18:37,655
BUT HER PHOTOS ARE NOW BURNING
BRIGHTLY AND BEAUTIFULLY.

465
00:18:37,655 --> 00:18:39,957
SO WHO IS THE FINALIST?

466
00:18:39,957 --> 00:18:42,259
IS IT THE GIRL
THAT'S BEEN CONSISTENT,

467
00:18:42,259 --> 00:18:45,262
OR IS IT THE GIRL THAT'S
COME A LONG WAY?

468
00:18:45,262 --> 00:18:47,965
THE GIRL THAT
WILL BE JOINING NIK,

469
00:18:47,965 --> 00:18:49,233
AND THAT WILL BE
A FINALIST...

470
00:19:03,414 --> 00:19:06,650
THE GIRL THAT
WILL BE JOINING NIK,

471
00:19:06,650 --> 00:19:07,818
AND THAT WILL BE
A FINALIST...

472
00:19:14,225 --> 00:19:15,259
NICOLE.

473
00:19:25,769 --> 00:19:28,239
YOU SHOULD BE
PROUD OF YOURSELF.

474
00:19:28,239 --> 00:19:29,807
YOU CAN'T FREEZE IN THIS
FINAL FASHION SHOW

475
00:19:29,807 --> 00:19:31,508
LIKE YOU DID
ON THAT COMMERCIAL.

476
00:19:31,508 --> 00:19:35,379
WE WANT TO SEE THAT STRONG,
CONSISTENT GIRL.

477
00:19:35,379 --> 00:19:37,448
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- THANK YOU.

478
00:19:46,557 --> 00:19:48,359
- THANK YOU.
- YOU'RE WELCOME, BRE.

479
00:19:56,667 --> 00:19:59,336
I AM DISAPPOINTED THAT
I DIDN'T WIN THE COMPETITION

480
00:19:59,336 --> 00:20:02,606
BUT I AM VERY GLAD THAT I
MADE IT AS FAR AS I DID HERE.

481
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,876
I CAME A LONG WAY
IN THIS COMPETITION.

482
00:20:05,876 --> 00:20:07,978
THEY TOOK THIS LITTLE
BLACK GIRL FROM HARLEM

483
00:20:07,978 --> 00:20:09,613
AND TOOK HER TO LONDON
TO MODEL.

484
00:20:09,613 --> 00:20:12,483
SHE AIN'T NEVER BEEN
OUT OF THE COUNTRY.

485
00:20:12,483 --> 00:20:14,485
LIFE IS FULL OF
DISAPPOINTMENTS.

486
00:20:14,485 --> 00:20:16,954
TYRA TOLD US HOW MANY DOORS
HAD BEEN SLAMMED IN HER FACE

487
00:20:16,954 --> 00:20:18,756
BEFORE SHE GOT
TO WHERE SHE GOT TO GO.

488
00:20:18,756 --> 00:20:20,691
MY PATH CAN ONLY GO UP
FROM HERE.

489
00:20:20,691 --> 00:20:21,792
IT'S NOTHING BUT UP.

490
00:20:34,939 --> 00:20:36,373
GIRL, CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?

491
00:20:36,373 --> 00:20:38,375
FINAL TWO, YEAH--
ME AND YOU.

492
00:20:38,375 --> 00:20:40,978
MAKING IT
TO THE TOP TWO IS AWESOME

493
00:20:40,978 --> 00:20:43,547
BECAUSE IT GIVES ME
ONE MORE CHANCE TO PROVE

494
00:20:43,547 --> 00:20:45,582
THAT I HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

495
00:20:45,582 --> 00:20:47,618
ME AND NICOLE,
I DON'T KNOW IF WE'RE FRIENDS.

496
00:20:47,618 --> 00:20:49,687
WE'RE TWO DIFFERENT PEOPLE,
TWO DIFFERENT AGES,

497
00:20:49,687 --> 00:20:51,655
TWO DIFFERENT PLACES IN
OUR LIFE-- NOT MUCH IN COMMON.

498
00:20:54,491 --> 00:20:56,961
WHAT IS YOUR PROBLEM?
HAVE A SENSE OF HUMOR!

499
00:20:56,961 --> 00:20:58,963
I DO.
IT'S NOT FUNNY.

500
00:20:58,963 --> 00:21:00,464
COME ON, GIRL.

501
00:21:00,464 --> 00:21:02,433
NIK JUST KIND OF LIKES TO BE
A LITTLE MORE RESERVED

502
00:21:02,433 --> 00:21:03,867
AND KEEPS TO HERSELF.

503
00:21:03,867 --> 00:21:06,370
I'M JUST NOT AFRAID TO, LIKE,
EMBRACE THE DORK IN ME.

504
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:11,342
T-MAIL.

505
00:21:11,342 --> 00:21:12,977
TYRA MAIL!
TYRA MAIL!

506
00:21:12,977 --> 00:21:14,878
THIS IS PROBABLY
OUR LAST TYRA MAIL.

507
00:21:14,878 --> 00:21:17,581
"YOU CAN'T TELL A BOOK
BY ITS COVER, OR CAN YOU?

508
00:21:17,581 --> 00:21:18,949
BE READY AT 7:45."

509
00:21:27,257 --> 00:21:28,826
- HI.
- HEY.

510
00:21:28,826 --> 00:21:31,762
TODAY THE TRAINING WHEELS
ARE COMING OFF.

511
00:21:31,762 --> 00:21:33,664
I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.
WE'VE GONE THROUGH
ALL THESE WEEKS.

512
00:21:33,664 --> 00:21:34,898
I ALMOST FEEL
LIKE I WANT TO CRY.

513
00:21:34,898 --> 00:21:36,800
I AM NOT GOING TO BE HERE.

514
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:39,536
YOU GIRLS ARE GOING TO BE
DOING YOUR PHOTO SHOOT

515
00:21:39,536 --> 00:21:43,474
FOR "ELLE GIRL" MAGAZINE,
SHOT BY GILLES BENSIMON.

516
00:21:43,474 --> 00:21:47,478
SO WHOEVER WINS
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"

517
00:21:47,478 --> 00:21:49,513
IS GONNA HAVE THE WORK
THAT THEY DO IN THERE TODAY

518
00:21:49,513 --> 00:21:53,250
GRACE THE COVER OF "ELLE GIRL"
MAGAZINE IN FEBRUARY 2006.

519
00:21:53,250 --> 00:21:55,419
SO I AM GOING TO TURN YOU GIRLS
OVER TO THE "ELLE GIRL" TEAM.

520
00:21:55,419 --> 00:21:57,187
- HEY.
- HELLO.

521
00:21:57,187 --> 00:21:58,956
BRANDON HOLLY
IS THE EDITOR-IN-CHIEF.

522
00:21:58,956 --> 00:22:00,491
ONE OF YOU IS GONNA BE
ON OUR COVER.

523
00:22:00,491 --> 00:22:02,626
WE DON'T KNOW WHO,
SO BOTH OF YOU HAVE GOT TO ACT

524
00:22:02,626 --> 00:22:04,528
LIKE THIS IS YOUR COVER.

525
00:22:04,528 --> 00:22:06,964
I DO FEEL CONFIDENT THAT I CAN
GET A SUCCESSFUL PHOTO SHOOT

526
00:22:06,964 --> 00:22:08,832
WITHOUT JAY BEING AROUND.

527
00:22:08,832 --> 00:22:10,234
HIS JOB IS DONE,
AND NOW IT'S OUR TURN

528
00:22:10,234 --> 00:22:12,436
TO TAKE WHAT WE'VE LEARNED
AND PUT IT TO USE.

529
00:22:16,373 --> 00:22:18,675
ALTHOUGH I SQUEAKED THROUGH
THE LAST ELIMINATION,

530
00:22:18,675 --> 00:22:19,877
I DIDN'T DO WELL.

531
00:22:19,877 --> 00:22:21,412
I FEEL LIKE I HAVE
A LOT OF WORK TO DO,

532
00:22:21,412 --> 00:22:24,681
BUT I'M KEEPING UP IN SPIRITS
AND BELIEVING IN MYSELF.

533
00:22:24,681 --> 00:22:26,316
- YOU GOOD?
- I'M GOOD.

534
00:22:27,818 --> 00:22:29,753
THAT I LIKE.

535
00:22:29,753 --> 00:22:31,288
- VERY BEAUTIFUL.
- HI!

536
00:22:31,288 --> 00:22:33,690
LOOK WHO I AM SHOOTING WITH?
THIS IS GILLES BENSIMON,

537
00:22:33,690 --> 00:22:36,493
THE GUY THAT I'VE BEEN TALKING
ABOUT EVERY SINGLE WEEK.

538
00:22:36,493 --> 00:22:39,196
I'M FREAKING OUT
BECAUSE IT'S GILLES BENSIMON.

539
00:22:39,196 --> 00:22:40,964
FINALLY WE GET THE CHANCE
TO WORK WITH HIM.

540
00:22:40,964 --> 00:22:42,866
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU GUYS
KNOW THIS ABOUT GILLES,

541
00:22:42,866 --> 00:22:44,735
BUT HE IS A VERY BIG
PRACTICAL JOKER.

542
00:22:44,735 --> 00:22:47,271
THE VERY FIRST TIME
I MET HIM WAS IN PARIS,

543
00:22:47,271 --> 00:22:49,740
I WAS 17 YEARS OLD, AND I
HANDED HIM MY PORTFOLIO.

544
00:22:49,740 --> 00:22:51,809
HE WAS LIKE,
"YOU ARE THE UGLIEST GIRL

545
00:22:51,809 --> 00:22:53,944
I HAVE EVER SEEN IN MY LIFE,"

546
00:22:53,944 --> 00:22:55,412
AND THEN THE NEXT DAY
HE BOOKED ME.

547
00:22:55,412 --> 00:22:58,482
AND HE'S GONNA BE SHOOTING YOUR
"ELLE GIRL" COVER SHOTS TODAY.

548
00:22:58,482 --> 00:23:00,617
AND BY THE WAY, YOU GUYS ARE
DOING THE COVER TRI WITH ME.

549
00:23:00,617 --> 00:23:02,553
OH, MY GOODNESS.

550
00:23:02,553 --> 00:23:04,788
I'M DOIN' THIS PHOTO SHOOT
WITH TYRA.

551
00:23:04,788 --> 00:23:06,390
- WHOO.
- SO YOU GUYS READY?

552
00:23:06,390 --> 00:23:06,890
YEAH.

553
00:23:09,726 --> 00:23:10,961
I'M REALLY FEELING
THE PRESSURE.

554
00:23:10,961 --> 00:23:13,230
I KNOW I HAVE TO DO
A GOOD PHOTO SHOOT.

555
00:23:21,605 --> 00:23:22,673
NICOLE IS DEFINITELY
A BEAUTIFUL GIRL

556
00:23:22,673 --> 00:23:23,907
WITH SO MUCH POTENTIAL.

557
00:23:23,907 --> 00:23:25,442
BUT I'M TRYING
NOT TO FOCUS ON THAT.

558
00:23:25,442 --> 00:23:27,311
I'M TRYING TO FOCUS ON HOW
I CAN MAKE MYSELF SHINE

559
00:23:27,311 --> 00:23:29,346
AND MY PERSONALITY STAND OUT.

560
00:23:29,346 --> 00:23:31,215
EASY... SMILING.

561
00:23:31,215 --> 00:23:32,216
THERE YOU GO, YUP.

562
00:23:32,216 --> 00:23:33,684
JUST DON'T ROLL IT
ALL THE WAY UP.

563
00:23:33,684 --> 00:23:34,885
BUT THAT'S REALLY
GOOD RIGHT THERE.

564
00:23:43,293 --> 00:23:45,963
HEARING GILLES BENSIMON
TELL MY COMPETITOR

565
00:23:45,963 --> 00:23:47,297
IS THE WINNER...

566
00:23:47,297 --> 00:23:48,665
THANK YOU.

567
00:23:48,665 --> 00:23:50,267
...KIND OF THROWS YOU OFF
A LITTLE BIT.

568
00:23:50,267 --> 00:23:51,768
HELLO, AM I STILL HERE?

569
00:23:54,338 --> 00:23:56,773
MY GOAL IS TO WIN,
I HAD TO BE VERY CONFIDENT

570
00:23:56,773 --> 00:23:59,510
TO SHOW TYRA THAT I AM WHO
THEY'RE LOOKING FOR.

571
00:23:59,510 --> 00:24:00,944
OKAY, LET'S GO.

572
00:24:06,683 --> 00:24:09,219
IT'S A LITTLE INTIMIDATING
BEING IN THE TOP TWO WITH NIK.

573
00:24:09,219 --> 00:24:10,387
SHE IS SO BEAUTIFUL.

574
00:24:10,387 --> 00:24:11,588
I LOVE IT.

575
00:24:11,588 --> 00:24:13,390
THAT'S GOOD.
CHIN DOWN.

576
00:24:13,390 --> 00:24:15,325
SHE'S JUST IMPROVED A LOT
THROUGHOUT THE COMPETITION,

577
00:24:15,325 --> 00:24:17,194
SO IT'S NERVE-RACKING.

578
00:24:17,194 --> 00:24:20,230
SHE'S A GOOD GIRL.
SHE'S A WINNER.

579
00:24:20,230 --> 00:24:21,431
SHE'S A WINNER.

580
00:24:21,431 --> 00:24:23,367
GILLES BENSIMON
JUST CALLED NIK A WINNER.

581
00:24:23,367 --> 00:24:24,801
THAT'S NOT GREAT.

582
00:24:24,801 --> 00:24:26,603
LOVE THAT, LOVE THAT,
LOVE THAT.

583
00:24:26,603 --> 00:24:27,704
HE'S PLAYING GAMES.

584
00:24:27,704 --> 00:24:31,275
I'M THE ONE THAT
MAKES THE DECISION?

585
00:24:31,275 --> 00:24:32,709
NO, YOU DON'T MAKE
THE DECISION WHO WINS.

586
00:24:32,709 --> 00:24:33,810
THAT'S ME AND THE JUDGES.

587
00:24:35,746 --> 00:24:38,282
WELL, THANKS, GIRLS.
YOU GUYS DID A GOOD JOB.

588
00:24:38,282 --> 00:24:39,416
THAT WAS GREAT.

589
00:24:49,893 --> 00:24:53,230
MODELING ISN'T SOMETHING
THAT I JUST WOKE UP

590
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:55,365
ONE DAY AND SAID
I WANT TO GO AUDITION FOR.

591
00:24:55,365 --> 00:24:57,601
I HAVE BEEN TRYING THIS
SINCE I WAS A LITTLE GIRL.

592
00:24:57,601 --> 00:24:59,970
IT'S JUST EXCITING
AND WEIRD TO KNOW

593
00:24:59,970 --> 00:25:02,272
THAT IT COULD BE
COMING TRUE.

594
00:25:02,272 --> 00:25:04,374
I FEEL LIKE
I'VE NEVER BEEN NUMBER ONE.

595
00:25:04,374 --> 00:25:07,945
I'VE NEVER HAD THAT ONE THING
THAT'S MADE ME LIKE STAND OUT.

596
00:25:07,945 --> 00:25:09,680
THIS HAS BEEN
MY DREAM FOREVER.

597
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,315
AND MAKING IT THIS FAR,

598
00:25:11,315 --> 00:25:14,484
IT'S LIKE YOU JUST WANT TO WIN
SO BAD 'CAUSE YOU'RE SO CLOSE.

599
00:25:24,661 --> 00:25:25,696
GOOD MORNING.

600
00:25:25,696 --> 00:25:27,364
- HELLO.
- HEY!

601
00:25:27,364 --> 00:25:29,900
TODAY IS REALLY LIKE
THE BIG ULTIMATE MOMENT.

602
00:25:29,900 --> 00:25:31,668
SO THIS IS THE RUNWAY SHOW.

603
00:25:31,668 --> 00:25:34,404
YOU'LL BE MODELING ALONGSIDE
WORKING PROFESSIONALS,

604
00:25:34,404 --> 00:25:37,641
INCLUDING PAST "AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL" WINNERS
EVA AND NAIMA.

605
00:25:37,641 --> 00:25:39,443
WHILE YOU GUYS WALK OUT,

606
00:25:39,443 --> 00:25:41,845
WE'RE GOING TO PROJECT
THESE ELEMENTS

607
00:25:41,845 --> 00:25:44,481
OF YOU GIRLS
SAYING SHAKESPEAREAN LINES.

608
00:25:44,481 --> 00:25:46,550
IT IS GOING TO BE EXCITING
JUST TO SEE OURSELVES

609
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,851
ON A JUMBO SCREEN.

610
00:25:47,851 --> 00:25:52,656
TO GET THE SUPER SCI-FI WALK,
WE HAD TO BRING OUR MISS THING.

611
00:25:54,324 --> 00:25:56,226
- WHOO!
- WHAT'S GOING ON, BITCHES?

612
00:25:56,226 --> 00:25:58,428
IT'S EARLY IN THE MORNIN'.

613
00:25:58,428 --> 00:26:00,764
SO BASICALLY, YOU'RE
GONNA STOMP THE RUNWAY,

614
00:26:00,764 --> 00:26:02,766
AND IT'S A REALLY
FAST WALK,

615
00:26:02,766 --> 00:26:05,502
WIDE STRIDE.

616
00:26:05,502 --> 00:26:06,570
SO ARE YOU READY TO GO
INTO HAIR AND MAKE UP?

617
00:26:06,570 --> 00:26:07,471
- YEAH.
- ALL RIGHT, LET'S GO.

618
00:26:14,278 --> 00:26:15,545
THERE IS SO MUCH GOING ON,

619
00:26:15,545 --> 00:26:18,181
SO IT'S JUST GONNA BE
LIKE FOCUSING MENTALLY,

620
00:26:18,181 --> 00:26:19,283
AND HOPEFULLY I CAN
GET IT DOWN.

621
00:26:20,951 --> 00:26:22,819
I'M FROM A SMALL TOWN
IN NORTH DAKOTA,

622
00:26:22,819 --> 00:26:25,489
AND THROUGH THIS WHOLE THING,
I HAVE JUST BEEN EXPOSED

623
00:26:25,489 --> 00:26:26,790
TO, LIKE, THIS
COMPLETELY DIFFERENT WORLD.

624
00:26:26,790 --> 00:26:29,493
AND I FEEL LIKE THIS IS MORE
THE WORLD WHERE I FIT IN.

625
00:26:29,493 --> 00:26:30,727
THIS IS THE WORLD
THAT I WANT TO BE IN.

626
00:26:34,865 --> 00:26:36,933
- HELLO.
- HELLO.

627
00:26:36,933 --> 00:26:38,635
HOW ARE YOU GUYS FEELING?

628
00:26:38,635 --> 00:26:39,670
- SHAKY--
- A LITTLE SHAKY.

629
00:26:39,670 --> 00:26:41,571
- NERVOUS--
- A LITTLE NERVOUS.

630
00:26:41,571 --> 00:26:43,774
BUT YOU CAN TRANSFORM THAT
INTO SOMETHING VERY POWERFUL,

631
00:26:43,774 --> 00:26:44,941
THAT SAME ENERGY.

632
00:26:44,941 --> 00:26:46,276
THIS IS YOUR OPPORTUNITY.

633
00:26:46,276 --> 00:26:48,278
THIS IS LIKE
YOUR LAST CHANCE.

634
00:26:48,278 --> 00:26:49,579
KICK EVERYBODY
OFF THE STAGE.

635
00:26:49,579 --> 00:26:51,548
COMMAND YOUR PRESENCE.
THAT'S WHAT IT'S ABOUT.

636
00:26:51,548 --> 00:26:52,883
THAT'S WHY I SAY
NO REGRETS.

637
00:26:52,883 --> 00:26:54,618
YOU HAVE TO DO EVERYTHING

638
00:26:54,618 --> 00:26:56,253
BECAUSE YOU CANNOT WALK AWAY
REGRETTING ANYTHING.

639
00:26:57,688 --> 00:27:01,658
RIGHT BEFORE IT'S TIME
TO WALK OUT ON THAT RUNWAY,

640
00:27:01,658 --> 00:27:04,461
I GO IN TO MEET WITH TYRA
AND I HAVE NEVER BEEN

641
00:27:04,461 --> 00:27:07,564
MORE EXCITED AND MORE
TERRIFIED AT THE SAME TIME.

642
00:27:07,564 --> 00:27:10,367
THIS IS YOUR LAST CHANCE
TO TELL ME

643
00:27:10,367 --> 00:27:12,703
WHATEVER YOU WANT TO TELL ME
BEFORE YOU GET ON THAT RUNWAY

644
00:27:12,703 --> 00:27:14,971
AND SHOW ME WHAT YOU GOT.

645
00:27:14,971 --> 00:27:18,375
I'VE NEVER FELT SO BLESSED
AND SO PROUD OF MYSELF, EVER!

646
00:27:18,375 --> 00:27:21,478
AND THERE'S SO MANY PEOPLE
IN MY LIFE THAT, YOU KNOW,

647
00:27:21,478 --> 00:27:23,613
"OH, YOU'LL DO GOOD," BUT THEY
NEVER REALLY BELIEVED IN ME.

648
00:27:23,613 --> 00:27:26,550
AND FOR THE FIRST TIME, AND
I KNOW THIS IS LIKE CLICHÉ,

649
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:29,319
BUT FOR THE FIRST TIME,
MY FATHER, HE'S JUST
SO PROUD OF ME.

650
00:27:29,319 --> 00:27:31,555
AND I JUST WANTED TO SAY
LIKE THANK YOU TO YOU,

651
00:27:31,555 --> 00:27:33,490
JUST BECAUSE I'VE NEVER
FELT THIS WAY BEFORE.

652
00:27:33,490 --> 00:27:36,360
AND I JUST WANT YOU TO KNOW THAT
I AM AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

653
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:37,894
I CAN JUST FEEL IT
IN MY HEART.

654
00:27:37,894 --> 00:27:39,429
AND JUST THANK YOU SO MUCH.

655
00:27:39,429 --> 00:27:41,698
JUST KNOW THAT YOU'RE HERE
BECAUSE OF YOU,

656
00:27:41,698 --> 00:27:44,401
AND YOU NEED TO FEEL THAT
WHEN YOU'RE ON THAT RUNWAY.

657
00:27:44,401 --> 00:27:46,403
- THANK YOU SO MUCH.
- YOU'RE WELCOME.

658
00:27:48,205 --> 00:27:50,707
I WANT TO TAKE YOU BACK
TO THE AUDITION PROCESS,

659
00:27:50,707 --> 00:27:51,975
DURING CASTING.

660
00:27:51,975 --> 00:27:53,744
I REMEMBER YOU SAID
THAT YOU'VE ALWAYS FELT

661
00:27:53,744 --> 00:27:55,312
SECOND BEST TO YOUR SISTER.

662
00:27:55,312 --> 00:27:58,348
I JUST FEEL LIKE I HAVE
SOMETHING OF MY OWN NOW--

663
00:27:58,348 --> 00:28:00,584
SOMETHING THAT I AM GOOD AT
AND THAT I CAN BE PROUD OF,

664
00:28:00,584 --> 00:28:04,755
AND YOU KNOW, THAT JUST FEELS--
THAT JUST FEELS SO GOOD.

665
00:28:04,755 --> 00:28:06,857
